#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = ertz garbiak jokoaren errendatze-tamainan. DLSS = bera bera, eta eskalatu egiten du "
"jokoaren Eskala %100 baino txikiagoa denean. ezgaituta = jokoaren irudia, alderatzeko. Berehala "
"gordetzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Zure GPUrako profilak. altua = dena gaituta (1. eredua). ertaina = 2. eredua, erdi-tamainako "
"zeharrargitasun-sakonera, pieza-mugimendurik gabeko ispilu lauak, pieza-mugimenduaren bilaketa "
"arinagoa. baxua = ispiluetan DLAA gabe ere, zeharrargitasun-sakonerarik gabe, VR eremua %60. "
"Inoiz ez du zuk ezarritakoa aldatzen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = xehetasun gehien, testu zorrotzena, 2aren GPUaren 1,6 aldi inguru. 2 (E) = orekatua, "
"trafikoaren atzean mamu gutxien: hemendik hasi. 3 (F) = bare hesietan eta kableetan, mugimenduko "
"xehetasuna lausotu dezake, 2ren kostu bera. 4 (M) = astunena (5 aldi inguru), pantaila lauko "
"probetarako bakarrik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Irudiaren kalitatea: zorroztasuna, testura-zorroztasuna, DLAA eremua eta "
"zeharrargitasun-sakonera. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den "
"bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Irudia zorrozten du DLAAren ondoren, 0 (ezgaituta) eta 1,0 artean. Igo irudia leuna bada; gehiegi "
"izanez gero ertzetan halo argiak ageri dira. 0,1 ms inguruko kostua; 0k urratsa saltatzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Zorroztasunaren irismena, 1etik 4 px-ra: txikia = xehetasun fina, handia = ertz sendoagoak. "
"Aldatu zorroztasuna fin edo lodiegi badirudi; pantaila baino handiagoa den irudiak, VRn bezala, 1 "
"px baino gehiago behar du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Testura-testu zorrotzagoa (seinaleak, aginte-panela, GPSa). 0 = ezgaituta; negatiboagoa = "
"zorrotzagoa baina dir-dir gehiago hesietan; probatu -0,5 eta -1 artean testua lausoa bada. GPU "
"kosturik ez, banda-zabalera pixka bat bakarrik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Berdin alanbre-hesietarako, belarrerako eta hosto-mozketetarako: igo 0ra hesiek dir-dir egiten "
"badute, jaitsi belarra leuna ageri bada. berdina = goiko lerroari jarraitzen dio. "
"Testura-zorroztasuna 0 ez denean bakarrik. GPU kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: begi bakoitzaren erdiguneak bakarrik jasotzen du DLAA (%20tik %100era); ertzak jokoaren "
"irudia mantentzen du. Jaitsi eredu astunago bat ordaintzeko edo fps irabazteko; %40k ereduaren "
"%40 inguru balio du. Garajeko / menuko kamioia ere finkatzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua bakarrik: DLAA jokoaren bloom / tonemap aurretik, errepideko marrek, kableek eta "
"bideek gutxiago dir-dir egin dezaten. Alderatzeko bakarrik aldatu. Ez dabil DLSS eskalatzearekin "
"ezta Windows HDRrekin. Kostu bera; ~60 fotograma behar ditu aldatzeko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Kableei, hesiei eta beirei beren distantzia ematen die, atzean dutena erabili beharrean, "
"mugitzean lausotu ez daitezen. Desgaitu lausotzerik ikusten ez baduzu: begiko 0,02 - 0,06 ms "
"aurrezten ditu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Argi-zutabeen eta autoen argien distira mugitzean arrastorik uztea saihesten du: DLSSk distira "
"bakoitza uneko fotogramatik hartzen du, ez historiatik. %25eko urratsak; jaitsi distirek dir-dir "
"egiten badute, 0 = ezgaituta. Begiko 0,05 - 0,2 ms inguru balio du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLAAk pieza mugikorrak eta kamioiaren ispiluak nola tratatzen dituen. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen "
"du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Pieza mugikor bakoitzari (trafikoa, gurpilak, matrikulak) bere mugimendua ematen dio DLAArentzat, "
"zorrotz geratu eta mamurik egin ez dezan. Desgaitu begiko 0,5 ms aurrezteko edo probatzeko "
"bakarrik: pixel guztiak kamerarekin mugitzen dira eta trafikoa lausotzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Kamioiaren ispiluei beren DLAA ematen die, dir-dir egin ez dezaten. 1 ispilu = handiena bakarrik "
"(zure ondokoa). guztiak = ispilu guztiak. kamera = ispilu bakoitzeko merkeena, trafiko mugikorrak "
"mamua egin dezake beiran; bestela pieza bakoitza zehatz mugitzen da beiran."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"gaituta = ispilu bakoitzak bere DLAA jasotzen du 2 fotogramatik behin eta tartean azken irudi "
"garbia erakusten du: kostuaren erdia inguru. Ertzak garbi; beiran mugitzen dena erdi-tasan "
"eguneratzen da. ezgaituta = ispilu guztiak fotograma guztietan."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Alanbre finek mugimendua mantentzen dute gidatzean: DLAAk mugimendu-datuak lerro finetan zehar "
"zabaltzen ditu (DLSS mugimendu-dilatazioa). gaituta = lehenetsia. ezgaituta = alderatzeko "
"bakarrik; alanbre hurbilek dir-dir gehiago egiten dute. Irudia une batez leun geratzen da "
"aldatzean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Alanbre finek ukitzen duten pixel guztietan jasotzen dute sakonera, ez erdigunea estaltzen duten "
"tokian bakarrik. gaituta = lehenetsia. gaituta (no A2C) = ertz zeharrargietan ere. ezgaituta = "
"alderatzeko bakarrik; alanbre hurbilek dir-dir gehiago."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Esperimentala: pixel 1 baino finagoak diren urruneko alanbreak pixel 1eko lerro gisa marrazten "
"ditu, zatitan hautsi ez daitezen. Lehenespenez ezgaituta: urruneko alanbreak ilunagoak ager "
"daitezke edo dir-dir gehiago egin. Probatu eta alderatu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS eskalatzea, DLAAren gaitu / desgaitu etengailua eta OFXR Bridge / VectorXR informazioa. "
"Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSSk irudia tamaina osora marrazten du berriro jokoaren Eskala %100 baino txikiagoa denean: "
"jokoaren luzapena baino zorrotzagoa, eta pixel gutxiagok fps gehiago esan nahi du. Kostu "
"gehigarririk ez; ez du ezer egiten Eskala %100ean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Mod osoa piztu edo itzaltzen du eta modua gordetzen du; ezgaituta dagoenean jokoaren irudia "
"ikusten da, alderatzeko. Desgaitzeak zati guztien kostua aurrezten du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = djules75en VR fotograma-sorkuntza, bereizitako deskarga "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). aurkituta = bere geruza joko honetan kargatuta dago eta modak "
"bere lana pasatzen uzten du. Hasi bere erretilu-aplikazioa jokoaren aurretik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = DienerTech-en OpenXR hobekuntza-multzoa (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"sakonera, fotograma-sorkuntza; aurkituta = bere geruza jokoan kargatuta dago eta modak bere lana "
"pasatzen uzten du. Erabili Turbo bakarra (berea edo modarena)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR bizkortzeak: Turbo, errendatze foveatua eta eremu ezkutuaren maskara. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / berrproiekziorik ez. VR bakarrik. Gaituta = jokoak ez du "
"fotograma bakoitzean kaskoaren zain egoten: fps gehiago CPUa muga denean bakarrik (hiri beteak, "
"trafikoa). Desgaitu irudia kolpeka badabil. OpenXR Toolkit-etik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Erdigune zorrotza, ertzean xehetasun gutxiago (NVIDIA RTX bakarrik). GPU aurrezten du Eskala "
"altuan. VR bakarrik. Kanpoko eraztuna 2 x 2 pixeleko behin itzalitzen da; hesiek, belarrak eta "
"hostoek xehetasun osoa mantentzen dute. Desgaitu ertza blokeka ikusten bada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Foveated (VRS) erdigune zorrotzaren tamaina, %10 - %100 %5eko urratsetan: handiagoa = ikuspegi "
"zorrotz gehiago, aurrezpen gutxiago; txikiagoa = aurrezpen gehiago, xehetasun gutxiago erditik "
"gertu. %80 (orekatua) lehenetsia da; 90 = zabala, 65 = estua."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Jokoaren zein pasadatan jarduten duen Foveated (VRS)-k. eszena = 3D mundua bakarrik (lehenetsia). "
"eszena + argiztapena = argiztapen-pasada ere, muturreko ertzean bakarrik: aurrezpen gehiago. "
"Probatu: bilatu argi- edo itzal-ertz blokedunak ikuspegiaren alboetan."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Foveated (VRS) kanpoko eraztuna zein lodia den. Normal = kolore 1 2 x 2 pixeleko (lehenetsia). "
"Indartsua = 4 x 2ko, Max = 4 x 4ko: GPU aurrezpen gehiago, ertz blokedunagoak. "
"Begi-jarraipenarekin hobe, kanpoko eraztunera inoiz begiratzen ez duzunean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Esperimentala. Foveated (VRS) erdigune zorrotzak zure begiak jarraitzen ditu begi-jarraipena duen "
"kaskoan (OpenXR begirada, adib. Varjo); gabe, lentearen erdian geratzen da. Foveated (VRS) "
"gaituta egon behar du jokoa hasterakoan, bestela berrabiarazi. Ia kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. Jokoak inoiz ikusten ez dituzun lentearen izkinak saltatzen ditu (kaskoak "
"jakinarazten ditu), pixel gutxiago marrazten ditu: GPU tarte gehiago, ikusten duzun irudia "
"berdina da. Lehen aldiz gaitzeko jokoa berrabiarazi behar da. Desgaitu ikuspegiaren ertza arraroa "
"bada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fotograma-tasaren mugak eta CPUa: NVIDIA Reflex eta FPS muga pantaila lauarentzat, VR FPS muga, "
"CPU doikuntza. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean "
"itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua bakarrik, NVIDIA bakarrik. Gaituta = jokoaren fotogramek GPU ilaran gutxiago "
"itxaroten dute: input lag gutxiago GPUa muga denean. Boost-ek GPU erlojuak altu ere mantentzen "
"ditu. Fps bera; kostu txikia. VRn ez da erabiltzen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua bakarrik. Jokoa gehienez tasa honetan mantentzen du: fotograma-denbora egonkorra, "
"bero eta energia gutxiago. Ezarri PCak hiri bete batean eusten duena baino pixka bat beherago. "
"Reflex gaituta badago, NVIDIA driverrak mugatzen du. ezgaituta = mugarik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. erdia = jokoak kaskoaren 2 fotogramatik 1 marrazten du (72 Hz -> 36 fps), herena = "
"3tik 1; kaskoaren berrproiekzioak (ASW / Motion Smoothing) gainerakoa erritmo egonkorrean "
"betetzen du. Erabili fps-ak gora-behera badabiltza. Turbo itzaltzen du aktibo dagoen bitartean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Hiru CPU etengailu batera: hari nagusiak eta errender-hariak P-cores nahiago dituzte (Intel CPU "
"hibridoak bakarrik), jokoa Normalaren gainetiko lehentasunarekin exekutatzen da, eta Windowsek "
"ezin du mugatu (EcoQoS) ezta bere tenporizadoreak ezikusi ere. CPUa muga denean lagun dezake; "
"kosturik ez. Doikuntza bereiziak dlaa.ini-n: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Panelaren posizioa, tamaina, sakonera eta norabidea, eta menuaren teklak. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. Buruari jarraitu = panela kaskoarekin mugitzen da. Kabinan finkoa = zure "
"eserlekuaren aurrean puntu batean geratzen da, ingurura begiratzean egonkor; X / Y / sakonerak "
"puntu hori ezartzen dute (graduak, metroak). VR geruza behar du (lehenetsia). Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau aldamenera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR kabinan finkoa: eserlekuaren inguruko "
"graduak). Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Erabili panelak behar "
"duzun zerbait estaltzen badu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau gora / behera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR kabinan finkoa: graduak, gehi = "
"behera). Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Erabili panelak behar duzun "
"zerbait estaltzen badu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau handiago edo txikiago egiten du. Igo irakurri ezin baduzu, jaitsi gehiegi estaltzen "
"badu. Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere tamaina gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. Panela zein urrun flotatzen duen: metrotan (0,30 - "
"3,00) VR geruza gisa, lehenetsia; begiko px-etan menu_vr_layer = 0 denean. Tamaina bera edozein "
"sakoneratan. Aldatu panelari begiratzea nekagarria bada. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. Gaituta = panela zure aldera biratzen da aldamenera "
"mugitzean, tamaina bera edozein angelutik (VR geruza gisa, lehenetsia, buruari jarraitzen dion "
"fps kutxa ere); ezgaituta = irudi laua. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"fps eta fotograma-denboraren kutxa txiki zuzena, menua itxita dagoenean ere (laua eta VR). "
"Erabili doikuntza batek zer irabazten duen ikusteko. GPU kostua neurtzen da: fotograma "
"bakoitzeko, marrazten den irudi bakoitzeko; ezer ez ezgaituta. Gorde-k hurrengo hasierarako "
"mantentzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren blokeoa, posizioa, tamaina, kolorea, VR distantzia eta biraketa. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. Buruari jarraitu = kaskoarekin mugitzen da. Jolas-eremuan finkoa = puntu bat "
"eserlekuaren inguruan, kabinaren dardara ez du kontuan hartzen. Ibilgailuari lotua = kabinari "
"itsatsita, harekin dardaratzen da (DLAA + pieza-mugimendu bektoreak behar ditu). Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, Ibilgailuari lotua bakarrik. Gaituta = kamioi / auto bakoitzak bere fps kutxaren lekua "
"gordetzen du kabinan, biraketa, tamaina, kolorea, distira eta testua (dlaa.ini-n gordetzen da "
"menua ixtean). Ezgaituta = multzo bakarra ibilgailu guztientzat. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, Ibilgailuari lotua bakarrik. Eskuina = kabina berriro neurtu orain (geldi, aparkatuta) kutxa "
"tokiz kanpo badago. Ezkerra = ibilgailu honen kutxa lehenetsira bueltatzen da (lekua, biraketa, "
"tamaina, kolorea, testua); beste ibilgailuek berea mantentzen dute. Kutxa kabinarekiko zuzen dago."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa aldamenera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR finkoa / lotua: zure inguruko graduak). "
"Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa gora / behera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR finkoa / lotua: graduak, ken = gora). "
"Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa ezkerrera / eskuinera biratzen du bere "
"gainean, graduetan (+ = aurpegia eskuinera biratzen da). Erabili kutxa alboan dagoenean "
"okertzeko. 0 = zuri begira. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa makurtzen du, graduetan (+ = goialdea "
"zugandik aldentzen da, aginte-panelean etzanda bezala). 0 = zuri begira. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa bere planoan biratzen du, graduetan (+ = "
"erlojuaren noranzkoan). 0 = zutik. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa handiago edo txikiago egiten du (0,2 .. 3,0). Igo kaskoan edo pantaila handian irakurri "
"ezin baduzu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren testuaren kolorea: 20 kolore, bakoitzak ertz batekin edozein irudiren gainean "
"irakurtzeko (beltza zuriaren gainean = testu iluna, ertz zuria). Laua eta VR. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren distira, %10 - %100: 100 = kolorea den bezala, gutxiago testua ilunagotzen du (ertza "
"mantentzen da) beltzera. Erabili kontagailua gauez edo kaskoan apaltzeko. Laua eta VR. Kosturik "
"ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa osoa zein zeharrargia den, %10 - %100: 100 = solidoa, gutxiago testua ETA bere ertz "
"beltza batera lausotzen ditu, kutxa ilundu batek orban beltz bihur ez dadin. Laua eta VR. "
"Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa zein urrun flotatzen duen, 0,30 - 3,00 m. "
"Tamaina bera mantentzen du zure ikuspegian edozein distantziatan; sakonera bakarrik aldatzen da. "
"Jarri begiratzen duzun sakonerara hurbil, fokua aldatu gabe irakurtzeko. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"dlaa_inject.log-era zer doan: ezgaituta = ezer ez; erroreak = hutsegiteak bakarrik (lehenetsia); "
"abisuak = + saihestutako arazoak; info = + hasiera eta aldaketak; debug = + estatistikak, eta "
"debug-ek GPU tenporizadoreak eta CPU profilerra ere martxan jartzen ditu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Menu honen hizkuntza. auto = jokoaren hizkuntza (lehenetsia); Ezkerra / Eskuina beste bat "
"aukeratzen du. Linux / Proton: txinera, japoniera eta koreerak beren letra-tipoak instalatuta "
"behar dituzte, ikusi README. DLLaren ondoko lang\\<code>.po fitxategiak lehentasuna du, zure "
"zuzenketentzat. Gorde-k mantentzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Menu honen lasterbide guztiak, ekintza bakoitzeko lerro bat, teklatuko teklarekin eta "
"kontrolagailuko botoiarekin. Eskuinak zerrenda irekitzen du; aukeratu ekintza bat Eskuinarekin "
"eta sakatu tekla edo boluntearen botoi berria. Berehala gordetzen da dlaa.ini-n."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Hemen erakusten den guztia dlaa.ini-n idazten du (doikuntzak, eta panelaren / fps kutxaren "
"posizioak mugitu ondoren), beste lerroak mantenduz. Egin ezazu emaitza gustatzen zaizunean, "
"bestela aldaketak galtzen dira hurrengo hasieran. Modua bere kabuz gordetzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Menu honetako doikuntza guztiak modak ekartzen dituen moduan jartzen ditu berriro (eredua, "
"zorroztasuna, testura-zorroztasuna, DLAA eremua, mugimendua, ispiluak, profila, panela, fps "
"kutxa, turbo, foveated, fotograma-tasa, erregistroa), zuzenean eta dlaa.ini-n, zure lasterbideak "
"eta beste lerroak mantenduz."

