#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Menu nagusira itzultzen da. %hs-k gauza bera egiten du orri honetako lerro guztietan. Menuko 5 "
"teklak izan ezik, tekla eta kontrolagailu-botoi guztiek jokora iristen jarraitzen dute menu hau "
"irekita dagoenean, beraz gidatzen jarrai dezakezu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Sakatu tekla edo kontrolagailu-botoi BERRI BAT %ls-rentzat: edozein tekla, baita beste menu-tekla "
"bat ere (hartatik kentzen da). Orain sakatuta dauden teklak / botoiak ez dira kontuan hartzen "
"askatu arte. Esc edo Backspace-k bertan behera uzten du, baita 10 s sakatu gabe ere; menu-teklak "
"ezin dira hemen garbitu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Sakatu tekla BERRI BAT (Shift / Ctrl / Alt-ekin konbinazioa egiten da) edo kontrolagailu-botoi / "
"D-pad norabide bat. Orain sakatuta dauden teklak / botoiak (aldagailuko marcha bat) ez dira "
"kontuan hartzen askatu arte; ardatzak ez dira inoiz esleitzen. %hs edo Esc-ek bertan behera uzten "
"du, Backspace-k bat ere ez uzten du, 10 s sakatu gabe bertan behera."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Menu hau gidatzen duten 5 teklaren bat (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, gero sakatu tekla edo botoi berria: "
"beste menu-teklak ere hartu daitezke. Lerro hauek ezin dira garbitu, eta 5etako bakoitzak "
"esleipen bat mantendu behar du (beste bat hutsik uzten duen sakatzea baztertzen da). Berehala "
"gordetzen da dlaa.ini-n."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, gero sakatu tekla edo botoi berria: tekla batek Teklatua zatia "
"ordezkatzen du, kontrolagailu-botoi edo D-pad norabide batek Kontrolagailua zatia. Beste ekintza "
"batek erabilitako tekla / botoia hona pasatzen da. Berehala gordetzen da dlaa.ini-n."

